OL,3,AMasked boy guilty of trying to murder
OL,4,Aschoolgirl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA masked teenager who was captured on
OL,7,FCCTV stabbing a schoolgirl has been
OL,8,Ffound guilty of attempted murder.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Thorpe St Andrew
OL,11,FSchool, near Norwich, on 11 March
OL,12,Ffollowing reports that a 15-year-old
OL,13,Fgirl had been stabbed in the back.
OL,15,FHer attacker brought a knife to school,
OL,16,Fwas dressed in black, was wearing a
OL,17,Fface mask and had written notes saying
OL,18,Fhe hated women, the trial at King's
OL,19,FLynn Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
